          %h2#idea Idea
          %p
            In the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/axiom"} axiomatics
            of
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/differential+cohesion"} differential cohesion
            one may
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/synthetic+differential+geometry"} synthetically
            formulate a concept of
            %em
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/manifolds"} manifolds
            locally modeled on a
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/group+object"} group object
            = succeed "." do
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mi V
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} V
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/interpretation"} interpretation
            in an
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/differential+cohesion"} differentially
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/cohesive+%28infinity%2C1%29-topos"} cohesive (infinity,1)-topos
            these are
            = succeed "." do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/%C3%A9tale+infinity-groupoids"} étale infinity-groupoids
          %p
